/-
Trusted code for raft's `go.etcd.io/raft/v3/raftpb` (`raft.pb.go`, generated by protoc-gen-go), in
namespace `go_etcd_io.raft.v3.raftpb` like the generated package
(`RaftWitness/Code/go_etcd_io/raft/v3/raftpb.toml`; the copy, for the witness experiment, of `TrustedCode/go_etcd_io/raft/v3/raftpb.lean`).

The protobuf file descriptor and its initialization (`raft.pb.go`):

```go
var file_raft_proto_enumTypes = make([]protoimpl.EnumInfo, 4)
var file_raft_proto_msgTypes = make([]protoimpl.MessageInfo, 10)
var file_raft_proto_goTypes = []any{ (EntryType)(0), ..., (*ConfChangeV2)(nil) }
var file_raft_proto_depIdxs = []int32{ 0, 10, 5, ... }

func init() { file_raft_proto_init() }
func file_raft_proto_init() {
	if File_raft_proto != nil {
		return
	}
	type x struct{}
	out := protoimpl.TypeBuilder{
		File: protoimpl.DescBuilder{
			GoPackagePath: reflect.TypeOf(x{}).PkgPath(),
			RawDescriptor: unsafe.Slice(unsafe.StringData(file_raft_proto_rawDesc), ...),
			...
		},
		GoTypes:           file_raft_proto_goTypes,
		DependencyIndexes: file_raft_proto_depIdxs,
		EnumInfos:         file_raft_proto_enumTypes,
		MessageInfos:      file_raft_proto_msgTypes,
	}.Build()
	File_raft_proto = out.File
	file_raft_proto_goTypes = nil
	file_raft_proto_depIdxs = nil
}
```

`goTypes` and `depIdxs` are translated. The other two tables and `init` are trusted, with models
that do nothing (2026-10-20; until then each was an axiom of the translation, and the
trust-boundary axioms `raftpb.opaqueInitsOk` and `raftpb.initFuncsOk` said they return). Only the
untranslated protobuf plumbing reads them (`file_raft_proto_init`, the messages' `ProtoReflect`
through `file_raft_proto_msgTypes[i]`, the enums' `Descriptor`/`Type`), and a translated reader
could not load them: nothing gives a points-to for them (`raftpb`'s `isPkgInit` is `True`).
-/
